# Magicite (San d'Oria 4-1) at status 3, the stones set by a GM one by one: _6r9 with two of the three: nothing from the
# mission (its file answers nil there), _6r9's own 138; Aldo with any stone: 183; the three stones and the Airship Pass:
# _6r9 60 (1, 0), whose finish takes the stones, gives 20000 gil, the title and status 4.
lists RuludeGardens/Nelcabrit/onTrigger RuludeGardens/_6r5/onTrigger RuludeGardens/_6r9/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/130 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/128 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/60 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/36 LowerJeuno/Aldo/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Muckvix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/152 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/184 UpperJeuno/Geebeh/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Paya-Sabya/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/80 AltarRoom/Magicite/onTrigger AltarRoom/onZoneIn/1 AltarRoom/onEventFinish/44 AltarRoom/onEventFinish/10000 MonasticCavern/Magicite/onTrigger MonasticCavern/onEventFinish/0 QulunDome/Magicite/onTrigger QulunDome/onEventFinish/0
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=-32,9,-47 job=WAR lvl=50 nation=0
